OL,3,GNEWSANew group aims to create 'thriving
OL,4,Atown centre'
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to make an Oxfordshire town more
OL,7,Fwelcoming and a better place for those
OL,8,Fliving there have been discussed by a
OL,9,Fnew group.
OL,11,FThe Carterton Area Place Board (CAPB)
OL,12,Fhas been created to bring together
OL,13,Fmembers of the public with businesses,
OL,14,Fcouncillors and voluntary
OL,15,Forganisations.
OL,17,FIts aim is to deliver improvements to
OL,18,Fthe town and its surrounding villages.
